{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["<b>Coming from Beer-Lachai-Roi.</b> That he had gone to bring Hagar to Abraham his father, to take her back." "<b>Dwelling in the land of the Negev.</b> Near that well, as it says, ״וַיִּסַּע מִשָּׁם אַבְרָהָם אַרְצָה הַנֶּגֶב וַיֵּשֶׁב בֵּין קָדֵשׁ וּבֵין שׁוּר״ (Genesis 20), and there was the well, as it says, ״הִנֵּה בֵין קָדֵשׁ וּבֵין בָּרֶד״ (ibid. 16)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:21.760400282Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}